- But this won&#8217;t happen? Why?

=== layout: one-panel

# *Summary of Genetic Drift*

@body

- Genetic drift is significant in small populations
- Genetic drift can cause allele frequencies to change at random
- Genetic drift can lead to a loss of genetic variation within populations
- Genetic drift can cause harmful alleles to become fixed

=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Drift changes allele frequencies through random sampling.
- Small populations are more strongly affected.
- Founder events and bottlenecks can change allele frequencies.
- Drift can reduce heterozygosity and fix alleles.

